{"complete_extracted_copy":false,"coverage":"centralized-copy","entries":{"medication-schedule.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer":{"context":"medication-schedule UI copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","source_hash":"c16b8bb9e2f93067440366904c808d8c54daf7e93010ba0a388e1671d9faed70","translation":"ይህ አዘጋጅ ብቻ ነው. መድሃኒቶችን ወይም መጠንን አያበረታታም፣ ግንኙነቶችን አያረጋግጥም፣ ቀን መቁጠሪያዎን አያስቀምጥም፣ ወይም ማስታወቂያዎችን አይልክም። መድሃኒቶችዎን ይከተሉ እና ለውጦችን ከማድረጉ በፊት የሕክምና ወይም የፋርማሲ ባለሙያዎን ይጠይቁ። ገጹ አይነግረዎትም ፣ ስለዚህ እንደ ማስታወቂያ አትመካበት።"},"medication-schedule.copy.howAnswer":{"context":"medication-schedule UI copy.howAnswer","source_hash":"43800e8610530e995b3a291fb29952b56bf1eb4ede9d631dcefab8492f6eea61","translation":"አንድ መስመር በእያንዳንዱ የተቀመጠው ነገር እንደ ስም | የተቀመጠው መመሪያዎች | 24-ሰዓት ጊዜ | የዕለት ወይም የሳምንቱ ቀን አጫጭር መግለጫዎች ያስገቡ. ይህ መሣሪያ በጊዜ እስከ 100 መዝገቦች ድረስ ይዘረዝራል እና CSV ያውርዱ"},"medication-schedule.copy.messages.canvasUnavailable":{"context":"Shared UI copy.messages.canvasUnavailable","source_hash":"87f1714ac2b50a74f2590e77ef89541657c6dcc3726bc088d40302e09fc91137","translation":"ይህ መቃኛ ቅድመ ዕይታን ማዘጋጀት አልቻለም"},"medication-schedule.copy.messages.copyUnavailable":{"context":"Shared UI copy.messages.copyUnavailable","source_hash":"2eb044e6057cc7d4d73d582e1a78b365a7c1a1ba784a90b401e8a18766a332d5","translation":"ቅጂው በዚህ መቃኛ ውስጥ አልተገኘም"},"medication-schedule.copy.messages.noEvent":{"context":"Shared UI copy.messages.noEvent","source_hash":"fada4bbd7921e74e716f9bc535ac0b187b4458e6292f18a99a5d0717427d13af","translation":"በዚህ ቀን በዚህ ቦታ ምንም ክስተት የለም"}},"locale":"am","missing":["medication-schedule.copy.intro","medication-schedule.copy.howQuestion","medication-schedule.copy.privacyQuestion","medication-schedule.copy.privacyAnswer","medication-schedule.copy.actions.run","medication-schedule.copy.actions.example","medication-schedule.copy.actions.reset","medication-schedule.copy.actions.copy","medication-schedule.copy.actions.download","medication-schedule.copy.actions.start","medication-schedule.copy.actions.pause","medication-schedule.copy.actio